type: software
title: "AMBER (Agent-based Modeling with Blazingly Efficient Records)"
abstract: >-
  AMBER is a Python framework for agent-based modeling that uses Polars for
  efficient columnar population state, with vectorized and optional GPU
  execution lanes.
